                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "81508b74-399c-3470-9590-0f6f15df994b",
                        "entry_id": "82808f48-9e3a-3dc3-a8cf-16412573898e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "gegen Fremde nur ablehnende oder direkt feindliche Gesinnung"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2cb82e77-d119-4137-90f2-05214c764421",
                                "sense_id": "81508b74-399c-3470-9590-0f6f15df994b",
                                "text": "„Vier Münchner Bürger mobilisierten damals 400000 Menschen und gingen am 6. Dezember 1992 gegen Fremdenfeindlichkeit und Rechtsradikalismus auf die Straße.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ecfd093d-ac02-42cc-ab0d-442d34e6e1ea",
                        "source_entry_id": "82808f48-9e3a-3dc3-a8cf-16412573898e",
                        "source_sense_id": "81508b74-399c-3470-9590-0f6f15df994b",
                        "source_sense_description": "gegen Fremde nur ablehnende oder direkt feindliche Gesinnung",
                        "target_lang_word": "xenophobia",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "xenophobia",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "67980fc8-7cb7-33aa-9000-e598d8b79e4a",
                                        "entry_id": "ed8a4d0e-50f9-3843-b5e9-051fd41ae38e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fear, antipathy, or hatred of strangers or foreigners."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "589db630-2c15-483f-8878-6edf656213a8",
                                                "sense_id": "67980fc8-7cb7-33aa-9000-e598d8b79e4a",
                                                "text": "The great sociologist Zygmunt Bauman argued that philo-Semitism and anti-Semitism both fall under “allosemitism”: literally Othering the Jew. He defined it not as resentment of what is different, which is xenophobia, but rather of what defies order and clear categories. In 1997, he wrote, “The Jew is ambivalence incarnate. And ambivalence is ambivalence mostly because it cannot be contemplated without ambivalent feeling: it is simultaneously attractive and repelling.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c41f2ba4-497f-4984-bead-996303a8223b",
                                                "sense_id": "67980fc8-7cb7-33aa-9000-e598d8b79e4a",
                                                "text": "The United States is not the only country where xenophobia pays dividends for politicians."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5abf632e-e5fc-49b0-8eff-6fcdfd08437c",
                                                "sense_id": "67980fc8-7cb7-33aa-9000-e598d8b79e4a",
                                                "text": "Like the Communist party before it, the Front National claimed to speak for the “working class”. The class enemy was rebranded from “bourgeoisie” to “elite”, communist xenophobia about “international capital” was supplemented with xenophobia against immigrants, and the proletariat had to ally with former adversaries such as small business owners, but the essential claim of working-class dignity remained intact."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f815287c-ee99-3a1a-917e-f1a068c56268",
                                        "entry_id": "ed8a4d0e-50f9-3843-b5e9-051fd41ae38e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fear of aliens."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "nonstandard",
                                            "rare",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6ab6fa2f-de71-4c66-a13c-a35d9db2478f",
                        "source_entry_id": "82808f48-9e3a-3dc3-a8cf-16412573898e",
                        "source_sense_id": "81508b74-399c-3470-9590-0f6f15df994b",
                        "source_sense_description": "gegen Fremde nur ablehnende oder direkt feindliche Gesinnung",
                        "target_lang_word": "xénophobie",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "xénophobie",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2caa5360-885e-3886-8b77-2cfc01e55d79",
                                        "entry_id": "29f84aff-37ec-3467-acd7-8762809f0fdb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Réaction ou sentiment de rejet des étrangers ou de ce qui provient de l’étranger."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "09d8c244-9078-4c7c-851a-a020e5faa89b",
                                                "sense_id": "2caa5360-885e-3886-8b77-2cfc01e55d79",
                                                "text": "Il se manifesta chez lui un revirement complet correspondant à une crise de mysticisme ou de xénophobie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f2d0785-1878-4f26-86b7-055b563b4ccb",
                                                "sense_id": "2caa5360-885e-3886-8b77-2cfc01e55d79",
                                                "text": "Et les thèmes comme la grossophobie, la xénophobie ou le harcèlement sont amenés sans que le roman perde de son humour."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "91be6278-1358-3285-80f5-93317a829876",
                                        "entry_id": "29f84aff-37ec-3467-acd7-8762809f0fdb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Haine des étrangers ou de ce qui provient de l’étranger."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "36ac0c8f-0338-41c4-ad38-5d842f1f1432",
                                                "sense_id": "91be6278-1358-3285-80f5-93317a829876",
                                                "text": "Moukden fut un grand centre d’agitation des Boxeurs qui mirent la ville à feu et à sang, incendièrent sous couleur de xénophobie, pour les mieux piller, beaucoup de boutiques de malheureux commerçants qui avaient quelques objets d’exportation européenne."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e69c4eb-3e6e-49f0-9155-c109c3cec643",
                                                "sense_id": "91be6278-1358-3285-80f5-93317a829876",
                                                "text": "C’est peut-être cette expérience de la xénophobie ordinaire qui me conforte dans ma solidarité pour des gens qui ne la méritent pas."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ba445bf2-4235-4a43-96d4-3a76caf572bc",
                        "source_entry_id": "82808f48-9e3a-3dc3-a8cf-16412573898e",
